# START-UP DIASPORA NEXT GEN

Supporting Romanian citizens from the diaspora who wish to return to the country and open a business with ESF financing.

Proposal

FINANCINGVALUE

Maximum 200,000 lei per beneficiary

FUNDING

Max 200,000 lei per beneficiary, 100% non-refundable amount

#### ELIGIBLEBENEFICIARIES

Newly established company or maximum 3 years old

#### OBLIGATIONS

Creation of a minimum of 2 full-time jobs over a period of 3 years;

All purchases must be new;

No selling allowed for 3 years;

Maintenance of activity during this period (no bankruptcy).

ELIGIBLE EXPENSES

Workspace;

Commercial vehicles;

Equipment;

Machinery;

Computers;

Furniture;

Website;

Software licenses;

Training courses;

Consultancy.

###### MORE DETAILS

FUNDING:

- Non-Repayable Financial Allocation – maximum 200,000 lei/beneficiary, an amount that can represent 100% of the eligible expenses (including VAT for non-paying companies) related to the project.

Eligible expenses: workspaces, utility vehicles, equipment, machinery, computers, furniture, website, software licenses, courses, consultancy, etc.

